   "grammar": {
    "intro": [
     "Present Perfect — o'tgan zamonda bo'lgan, lekin natijasi HOZIR ko'rinadigan ish. Vaqt aytilmaydi: \"I have lost my key\" (kalitim yo'q — hozir).",
     "Past Simple'dan farqi: Past Simple'da vaqt aniq (yesterday, in 2020), Present Perfect'da vaqt muhim emas — natija muhim.",
     "have/has — yordamchi; asosiy fe'l 3-shaklda (V3). Regular: V+ed; irregular — jadvaldan yod olinadi (bugungi lug'at)."
    ],
    "formulas": [
     [
      "Tasdiq",
      "S + have/has + V3",
      "I have started my business recently.",
      "Men yaqinda biznesimni boshladim."
     ],
     [
      "Inkor",
      "S + haven't/hasn't + V3",
      "We haven't finished yet.",
      "Biz hali tugatganimiz yo'q."
     ],
     [
      "Savol",
      "Have/Has + S + V3?",
      "Have you ever been to Tashkent?",
      "Qachondir Toshkentda bo'lganmisan?"
     ],
     [
      "Tajriba",
      "S + have/has + ever/never + V3",
      "She has never eaten sushi.",
      "U hech qachon sushi yemagan."
     ],
     [
      "been / gone",
      "have been to = borib kelgan; have gone to = ketgan (hali u yerda)",
      "He has gone to London.",
      "U Londonga ketgan (hali qaytmagan)."
